{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1142e8c4-79fb-8094-bd4c-f8ca3ed4eff0",
  "created_at": "2026-03-09T13:48:52-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lucia Resendes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:47:44-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:47:46-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes. I want to report a crosswalk. The paint's faded almost to nothing and cars don't stop for anybody. Hold on, I'm shaking out a rug on the porch, let me put you on my shoulder."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:47:58-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Where's the crosswalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:48:00-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "222 Ayrault Street, right out front of my building. And it's right in the bike lane, too, so the bikes fly through. I'd think somebody would've noticed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:48:09-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 222 Ayrault. Faded crosswalk, in the bike lane. I'll put in a request for a crew to look at the striping."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:48:16-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is that the rain? Because the paint was bad before Friday's rain, and that was two days ago. I don't want it blamed on the weather."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:48:24-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wet weather doesn't help paint, but I'll note it was already faded."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:48:28-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So how long do repairs like this usually take? And how do I know it's not just going in a pile?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:48:35-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Honestly it depends on the crew's schedule, and paint needs dry, warmer days. It could be a few weeks. The request goes in the system today, though."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:48:44-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few weeks. Alright. And it's definitely logged, today, Monday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:48:48-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Logged today, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:48:50-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Thank you."
    }
  ],
